    "The X1 showed neither its state right after power-on nor the state left by earlier use, so neither captured preview applies. Only reads, the startup command and the session start were sent: no window, mode, exposure, image read or scan.": {
      "comment": "Real preview stopped: unrecognised scanner state at session start",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le X1 n'a montré ni son état juste après la mise sous tension, ni l'état laissé par une utilisation précédente : aucun des aperçus capturés ne s'applique. Seules des lectures, la commande de démarrage et l'ouverture de session ont été envoyées : aucune fenêtre, aucun mode, aucune exposition, aucune lecture d'image, aucun scan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The X1 has been switched off and on since the interrupted preview": {
      "comment": "Real preview check, asked only after a real preview that did not complete",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le X1 a été éteint et rallumé depuis l'aperçu interrompu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One of FlexColor's two captured previews, chosen by the scanner's state, will be sent to the scanner command for command. Any difference stops it; Stop (⌘. or Esc) stays available. Every command is logged.": {
      "comment": "Confirmation text before a preview on the real X1",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'un des deux aperçus capturés de FlexColor, choisi d'après l'état du scanner, sera envoyé au scanner commande par commande. Toute différence l'arrête ; Arrêter (⌘. ou Échap) reste disponible. Chaque commande est journalisée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unexpected carriage position: preview stopped before the carriage was positioned. Switch the X1 off and on before starting the preview again.": {
      "comment": "Real preview stopped at the position check before the window with target 25 000",
